  "pros": [
    "High service intercommunication enables rich gaming features",
    "Services can directly coordinate for real-time gameplay",
    "Flexible data sharing between game systems",
    "Peer-to-peer service communication reduces latency"
  ],
  "cons": [
    "Complex service interdependencies increase debugging difficulty",
    "Higher network overhead from mesh communication",
    "Potential cascading failures across connected services",
    "More difficult to scale individual components independently"
  ],
